Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.39,0:00:06.23,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,There we go...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.50,0:00:09.90,Konosuba_Italics,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,I normally shut myself in at home,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.37,0:00:13.15,Konosuba_Italics,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,but unusually for me, \Ntoday I made up my mind to go out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.20,0:00:19.62,Konosuba_Italics,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,All to get my hands on \Nthe first-run limited edition
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.62,0:00:22.51,Konosuba_Italics,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,of a popular online game \Nthat goes on sale today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.13,0:00:34.38,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,A five-hour round trip! \NI'm glad I was able to buy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.56,0:00:38.11,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,In-store exclusives, official or not, \Nreally are playing dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.97,0:00:44.23,Konosuba_Italics,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,This sunlight is my worst enemy \Nafter three straight all-nighters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.84,0:00:46.98,Konosuba_Italics,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Time to get home and play the hell out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.76,0:00:54.27,Konosuba_Italics,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,A girl from my high school?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.95,0:01:01.45,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Look out! That truck's going to—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.93,0:01:08.07,Konosuba_Italics,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Why would I choose now, of all times,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.07,0:01:10.12,Konosuba_Italics,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,to do something so out of character?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.91,0:01:26.46,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,Satou Kazuma-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.25,0:01:29.11,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome to the afterlife.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.97,0:01:35.77,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,Unfortunately, you passed away moments ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.80,0:01:41.87,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,Your life was a short one,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.73,0:01:46.08,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,but you are, in fact, dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.03,0:01:50.04,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Just one question...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.06,0:01:54.63,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,What about the girl I \Npushed out of harm's way?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.04,0:01:57.35,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,She's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.85,0:02:01.26,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.76,0:02:04.35,Konosuba_Italics,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,That means my death wasn't in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.55,0:02:08.77,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,Actually, she wouldn't have gotten hurt,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.22,0:02:11.60,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,even if you hadn't pushed her out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.81,0:02:12.61,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.94,0:02:16.61,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,That tractor was going to stop before it hit her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.61,0:02:18.45,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.45,0:02:19.49,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.76,0:02:21.12,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,"Tractor"?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.75,0:02:24.00,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, it was a tractor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.45,0:02:25.89,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Then what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.27,0:02:28.87,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Did I die by getting plowed over by a tractor?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.87,0:02:30.92,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,No, you died of shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.92,0:02:33.13,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,You mistakenly thought a truck ran over you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.13,0:02:34.29,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,I died of shock?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.61,0:02:40.80,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,I've been doing this for a long time,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.80,0:02:44.35,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,but you're the first human to \Never die in such a bizarre way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.26,0:02:48.73,Konosuba_Italics,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,I've never even met this girl \Nbefore. What's her deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.73,0:02:51.89,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,You were so terrified that you'd \Nbe run over, you wet yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.89,0:02:54.09,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,You passed out and were \Ntaken to a nearby hospital,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.09,0:02:56.71,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,and the doctors and nurses laughed \Nat you as you had a heart attack—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.71,0:02:58.57,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Stop! I don't wanna hear it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.57,0:03:00.28,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,I don't wanna hear it! I don't wanna hear it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.28,0:03:02.74,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,Your family just rushed to the hospital,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.74,0:03:05.59,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,and now even they're laughing\Nout loud at the cause of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.59,0:03:06.87,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Stop! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.87,0:03:07.80,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.37,0:03:12.12,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,I've vented enough stress for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.67,0:03:13.63,Konosuba_Italics,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Damn her!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.96,0:03:15.60,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,My name is Aqua.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.12,0:03:19.84,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,I'm a goddess who guides humans \Nwho die young to the afterlife.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.13,0:03:22.79,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,You have two choices.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.25,0:03:25.75,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,You can start from square one with a new life,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.75,0:03:29.43,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,or you can go to Heaven and \Ncarry on like an old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.76,0:03:31.73,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,To tell you the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.22,0:03:35.40,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,Heaven isn't the dreamy place \Nyou all imagine it to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.40,0:03:36.12,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.34,0:03:38.78,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,Not only is there no TV, there are \Nno manga or games, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.78,0:03:40.53,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,You don't even have a physical body,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.90,0:03:44.08,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,so you can't do anything sexual, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.52,0:03:47.90,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,There's nothing to do there but \Nbask in the sun for all eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.90,0:03:49.08,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.57,0:03:53.52,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, you don't want to go to a \Nboring place like Heaven, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.52,0:03:55.26,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Uh, right...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.51,0:03:59.09,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,On the other hand, starting over \Nfrom square one isn't so fun, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.09,0:04:01.38,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,On that note, I've got a great offer for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.57,0:04:03.90,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,You like games, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.90,0:04:04.65,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.33,0:04:08.52,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,That world, which has long enjoyed peace,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.52,0:04:11.31,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,is being threatened by the Devil King's army!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.58,0:04:15.52,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,The livelihoods its citizens have worked \Nfor are being trampled by monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.52,0:04:20.32,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone lives in fear of the Devil King's \Narmy's merciless pillage and slaughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.95,0:04:22.44,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,...slaughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.97,0:04:28.52,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,Since that's the sort of world it is, \Neveryone refuses to be reborn,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.52,0:04:30.12,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,so the population is declining.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.32,0:04:31.40,Konosuba_Main,,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.40,0:04:33.90,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,So we decided, "Why not send people who've
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.90,0:04:38.46,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,died in other worlds there with their \Nbodies and memories intact?"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.96,0:04:41.78,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,What's the point in sending me there \Nif I'm just going to be killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.78,0:04:43.44,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,That's why I'm doing you a big favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.99,0:04:47.94,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,I'm granting you the right to bring any \None thing of your choosing with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.94,0:04:51.18,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,It could be a powerful weapon, \Nor a tremendous talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.39,0:04:54.94,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,You'll be able to redo your life \Nwith all of your original memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.94,0:04:57.77,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,To top it off, you can bring \None thing of your choosing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.15,0:04:59.71,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,And the people of the parallel world
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.71,0:05:01.92,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,will earn someone battle-ready to help them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.48,0:05:04.46,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,Not a bad deal, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.93,0:05:09.83,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Um, I want to ask something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.33,0:05:12.50,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Will I be able to speak this \Nother world's language?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.07,0:05:14.83,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,That won't be an issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.83,0:05:16.21,guide,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Parallel World Reincarnation Guide and Contract \N{\c&H66AC6B&\fs14}The First Ever Parallel World Guide! (For Shut-ins)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.42,0:05:19.08,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,With the kind support of us gods,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.38,0:05:23.29,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,we'll overload your brain so you'll \Nbe able to learn it instantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.55,0:05:25.36,caution,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Caution!\N{\c&H656F6D&}Because the process of installing the ability to speak the parallel world's language into the one \Nwho wishes to be reincarnated there (henceforth referred to as "Reincarnated") requires \Ninstantaneous overloading of the hippocampus and cerebral cortex (henceforth referred to as \N"Brain"), Reincarnated's Brain may, in rare cases, lose certain faculties (go "p**f"). Should \Nthis occur, according to Article 1296 Clauses 2 and 5 and Article 2051 Clause 3, \NReincarnated may not hold those responsible for his reincarnation accountable.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.29,0:05:24.36,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,As a side effect,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.36,0:05:26.81,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,you might just go "poof" \Nif you're unlucky, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.81,0:05:30.33,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,So all that leaves you to do is to choose \Na powerful ability or piece of equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.04,0:05:35.76,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,I just heard you mention \Nsomething really serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.54,0:05:37.90,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean, "poof"?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.90,0:05:38.98,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,I never said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.98,0:05:39.90,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.63,0:05:42.46,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,Now, choose!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.09,0:05:47.68,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,I'll grant you one power \Nthat is second to none!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.11,0:05:52.54,Konosuba_Italics,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,This is my gamer's intuition talking,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.54,0:05:55.59,Konosuba_Italics,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,but all of the abilities and equipment \Nhere are totally broken!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.94,0:05:59.83,Konosuba_Italics,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,If I'm going to a world where magic exists, \NI absolutely have to try it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.87,0:06:02.79,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, hurry it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.79,0:06:04.95,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,No matter what you pick, it's all the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.95,0:06:07.51,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,Nobody's expecting much from \Na shut-in game otaku anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.51,0:06:09.63,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,I-I'm not an otaku!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.63,0:06:12.51,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,And I died after leaving my house,\Nso I'm not a shut-in, either!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.76,0:06:17.45,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,None of that matters. Just hurry it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.45,0:06:20.65,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,I've still got lots more deceased \Nhumans to guide, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.65,0:06:21.98,Konosuba_Italics,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Damn her!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.38,0:06:26.56,Konosuba_Italics,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Getting all cocky just because \Nshe's a little bit cute...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.28,0:06:32.96,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,"Hurry up and decide," huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.68,0:06:35.41,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,I'll do just that, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.41,0:06:38.37,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Pick one thing to bring to \Nthis parallel world, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.37,0:06:39.63,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.59,0:06:43.94,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, I pick you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.63,0:06:53.66,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,All right, stand there and \Ndon't leave the magic circle—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.63,0:06:56.25,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,What did you just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.95,0:07:04.77,Konosuba_Main,Angel,0000,0000,0000,,We have heard your request.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.77,0:07:09.03,Konosuba_Main,Angel,0000,0000,0000,,I shall take over your job \Nfrom here on out, Aqua-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.03,0:07:09.66,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.32,0:07:14.87,Konosuba_Main,Angel,0000,0000,0000,,Satou Kazuma-san's wish complies with \Nthe regulations and has been accepted.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.87,0:07:18.38,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, what is all this? Wh-What? \NYou've got to be kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.38,0:07:20.87,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,No, no, no! Come on, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.87,0:07:25.35,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,This is not right! Taking a goddess \Nwith you is against the rules!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.35,0:07:28.21,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,It must be illegal! This has to be illegal!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.21,0:07:30.72,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,Wait! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.99,0:07:33.43,Konosuba_Main,Angel,0000,0000,0000,,Please have a safe trip, Aqua-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.43,0:07:35.63,Konosuba_Main,Angel,0000,0000,0000,,Should you successfully defeat the Devil King,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.63,0:07:37.22,Konosuba_Main,Angel,0000,0000,0000,,I will send someone to pick you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.43,0:07:40.23,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,I may have the ability to \Nheal since I'm a goddess,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.23,0:07:42.50,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,but I have no fighting ability to speak of!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.50,0:07:45.50,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,There's no way I can beat the Devil King!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.50,0:07:48.30,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.36,0:07:54.20,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,How does it feel to get dragged away with \Nthe guy you treated like a total idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.32,0:07:59.81,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,You've been designated as the one \N{\i1}thing{\i0} I'll be bringing along,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.81,0:08:01.93,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,so if you're a goddess, \Nuse your godly powers
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.93,0:08:04.08,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,or whatever to make my \Nlife as easy as possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.08,0:08:05.74,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.74,0:08:08.96,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want to go to a parallel \Nworld with a man like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.15,0:08:17.51,Konosuba_Main,Angel,0000,0000,0000,,Brave hero, I pray that of the \Ngreat many prospective heroes,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.51,0:08:20.71,Konosuba_Main,Angel,0000,0000,0000,,you will be the one to defeat the Devil King.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.71,0:08:23.32,Konosuba_Main,Angel,0000,0000,0000,,If you do so, we shall grant any wish
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.32,0:08:25.94,Konosuba_Main,Angel,0000,0000,0000,,you desire as a gift from the gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.94,0:08:27.36,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Whoa, for real?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.19,0:08:29.44,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,That's my line!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.44,0:08:31.69,Konosuba_Main,Angel,0000,0000,0000,,Now, go forth on your journey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.78,0:08:37.66,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.39,0:08:58.55,Beginner Town,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1148,1)}The Town of Beginning Adventurers
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.55,0:08:58.93,Beginner Town2,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,The Town of Beginning Adventurers
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.55,0:08:58.93,Beginner Town2,Sign,0001,0001,0145,,{\fs26\b1}Axel
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.93,0:08:59.81,Beginner Town3,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,The Town of Beginning Adventurers
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.93,0:08:59.81,Beginner Town3,Sign,0001,0001,0145,,{\fs26\b1}Axel
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.81,0:08:59.93,Beginner Town4,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,The Town of Beginning Adventurers
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.81,0:08:59.93,Beginner Town4,Sign,0001,0001,0145,,{\fs26\b1}Axel
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.93,0:09:01.39,Beginner Town5,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1,267)}The Town of Beginning Adventurers
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.93,0:09:01.39,Beginner Town5,Sign,0001,0001,0145,,{\fad(1,267)\fs26\b1}Axel
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.70,0:09:04.96,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,It's a parallel world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.21,0:09:07.34,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, this really is a parallel world!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.94,0:09:12.44,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,W-Wait, I'm really going to be using magic
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.44,0:09:15.74,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,and going on adventures \Nin this world from now on?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.37,0:09:22.31,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Goodbye, shut-in life! Hello, new world!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.31,0:09:25.13,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,I can really start anew in this world!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.15,0:09:27.63,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.63,0:09:31.38,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,What am I going to do if everyone \Nthinks I'm friends with a crazy woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.38,0:09:35.47,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,More importantly, isn't there something you're \Nsupposed to give me at a time like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.47,0:09:37.79,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Look at what I'm wearing. I'm in a tracksuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.79,0:09:41.31,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Here I am in a fantasy world, \Nand all I have is a single tracksuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.31,0:09:43.65,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't there a bare minimum of \Nstarter equipment I should—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.97,0:09:55.99,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What the heck?! Stop! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.99,0:09:58.45,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,I get it, okay?! I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.45,0:10:00.94,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,If you hate it that much, \Nthen you can go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.94,0:10:02.83,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,I'll work out the rest on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.03,0:10:04.85,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,What are you talking about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.85,0:10:06.76,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,I'm in trouble because I {\i1}can't{\i0} go back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.76,0:10:08.69,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,What do I do? Huh? What am I gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.69,0:10:11.57,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,What am I supposed to do from now on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.80,0:10:14.25,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, calm down, Goddess.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.51,0:10:16.23,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Times like these call for guilds.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.77,0:10:21.72,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Going to places like that to gather \Nintel is what you do in RPGs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.72,0:10:25.52,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? You're supposed to be \Nsome game otaku shut-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.52,0:10:27.27,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you so reliable?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.70,0:10:28.89,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,All right! Let's go, Goddess.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.89,0:10:30.20,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.33,0:10:33.72,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,You can call me "Goddess" if you like,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.72,0:10:36.65,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,but when you can, call me "Aqua," \Nso we don't cause a commotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.65,0:10:37.77,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.26,0:10:39.16,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,If you're a goddess,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.16,0:10:42.45,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,wouldn't you know where we can \Nfind an adventurer's guild?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.45,0:10:44.01,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,I'm a goddess.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.01,0:10:47.41,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,There's no way I'd know about \Nevery little lowly place like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.22,0:10:51.17,Konosuba_Italics,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,This girl's useless...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.17,0:10:52.21,Konosuba_Main,Shop,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.21,0:10:54.34,Konosuba_Main,Customer,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you. Up we go...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.47,0:10:55.92,Adventurer's Guild,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Adventurer's Guild
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.92,0:10:56.17,Adventurer's Guild2,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Adventurer's Guild
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.17,0:10:57.30,Adventurer's Guild3,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Adventurer's Guild
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.30,0:10:57.34,Adventurer's Guild3,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&H90DFEF&}Adventurer's Guild
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.34,0:10:57.38,Adventurer's Guild4,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&H90DFEF&}Adventurer's Guild
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.38,0:10:57.42,Adventurer's Guild4,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&H4C8AD8&}Adventurer's Guild
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.42,0:10:57.46,Adventurer's Guild4,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&H253C9A&}Adventurer's Guild
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.46,0:10:57.50,Adventurer's Guild5,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1,12)}Adventurer's Guild
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.63,0:10:59.54,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like this is the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.06,0:11:05.43,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,Scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.50,0:11:10.98,Konosuba_Main,C,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome! If you're here to eat, \Nplease take any open seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.36,0:11:13.96,Konosuba_Main,C,0000,0000,0000,,If you need job guidance, \Nhead to the counter inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.32,0:11:15.44,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.67,0:11:22.45,Konosuba_Main,Man,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.57,0:11:25.12,Konosuba_Main,Man,0000,0000,0000,,Haven't seen you around here before.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.30,0:11:29.32,Konosuba_Main,Man,0000,0000,0000,,And what's with the weird clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.32,0:11:34.00,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, we've actually come a long way, \Nand we just got into town.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.00,0:11:39.47,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,I want to become an adventurer \Nto fight the Devil King's army, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.15,0:11:43.59,Konosuba_Main,Man,0000,0000,0000,,Is that right, you reckless punk?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.59,0:11:46.36,Konosuba_Main,Man,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome to the gates of Hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.36,0:11:48.72,Konosuba_Main,Man,0000,0000,0000,,If you're lookin' for the guild \Nadmission desk, it's over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.44,0:11:53.27,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.09,0:11:58.01,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,How can you make up a story \Nlike that on the spot?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.35,0:11:59.61,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Listen, Aqua.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.61,0:12:00.32,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.59,0:12:04.03,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Today we'll register with a guild\Nand find a place to stay the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.40,0:12:07.52,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,G-Got it. I don't know anything about games,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.52,0:12:09.79,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,but I guess that's how it works\Nin worlds like this, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.25,0:12:12.90,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Exactly. All right, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.90,0:12:13.96,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.64,0:12:17.17,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,You seem like such a capable guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.89,0:12:21.72,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,Why were you a shut-in otaku with \Nno friends or girlfriend before?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.72,0:12:24.93,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,Why did you seclude yourself every day \Nand act like such a shut-in NEET?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.93,0:12:26.87,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Stop calling me a shut-in NEET, you bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.87,0:12:28.89,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Don't lump "shut-in" and "NEET" together.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.54,0:12:34.06,Konosuba_Main,Luna,0000,0000,0000,,Hello. What can I do for you today?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.35,0:12:36.81,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Um, we'd like to become adventurers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.81,0:12:38.33,Konosuba_Main,Luna,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.33,0:12:41.24,Konosuba_Main,Luna,0000,0000,0000,,In that case, you'll first need \Nto pay the registration fee.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.52,0:12:42.68,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Sure, sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.98,0:12:45.55,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Registration fee?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.06,0:12:47.31,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Do you have any money?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.45,0:12:50.72,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,You dragged me here without any warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.72,0:12:52.00,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,Of course I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.58,0:12:54.65,Konosuba_Italics,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,This girl's useless...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.66,0:13:04.09,Konosuba_Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Are you ready to order?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.66,0:13:07.70,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Um, I'm still thinking about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.70,0:13:08.76,Konosuba_Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Please take your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.90,0:13:11.19,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, what should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.71,0:13:13.18,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,We've already hit a roadblock.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.52,0:13:16.00,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Normally we'd get a minimal \Namount of equipment
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.00,0:13:19.04,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,and enough to cover basic \Nliving expenses, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.04,0:13:20.52,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,This is totally inhospitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.79,0:13:23.45,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,There goes your reliability, just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.45,0:13:26.13,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I guess it was inevitable. \NYou {\i1}are{\i0} a shut-in NEET.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.13,0:13:27.53,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Don't call me a shut-in NEET.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.53,0:13:30.53,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,Fine. I guess it's my turn now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.79,0:13:33.01,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,Let me show you what a goddess can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.84,0:13:39.92,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,You there, priest! State your denomination!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.15,0:13:41.62,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Aqua.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.62,0:13:46.13,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, the object of worship for the \NReligious Order of Axis: the goddess Aqua!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.65,0:13:49.29,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,If thou art one of my followers...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.91,0:13:53.12,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,It'd be a huge help if you \Ncould lend me some money!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.10,0:13:55.98,Konosuba_Main,Priest,0000,0000,0000,,I'm in the Eris Sect, actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.92,0:14:03.15,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, you are? I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.55,0:14:07.07,Konosuba_Main,Priest,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, young lady, are you with the Axis Sect?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.07,0:14:11.29,Konosuba_Main,Priest,0000,0000,0000,,The relationship of the goddesses Aqua and \NEris is that of superior and subordinate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.47,0:14:16.31,Konosuba_Main,Priest,0000,0000,0000,,This must be fate. I saw earlier that \Nyou couldn't cover the fee, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.49,0:14:21.07,Konosuba_Main,Priest,0000,0000,0000,,Here. Please consider this \NEris-sama's divine blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.07,0:14:25.70,Konosuba_Main,Priest,0000,0000,0000,,Still, no matter how devout a believer you \Nare, you mustn't call yourself a goddess.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.70,0:14:28.15,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,Uh, yes. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.15,0:14:29.68,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.04,0:14:36.43,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,He didn't even believe that I'm a goddess.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.43,0:14:41.41,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,By the way, Eris is a goddess ranked beneath me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.77,0:14:45.70,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,A believer in my subordinate took pity on me
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.09,0:14:48.41,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,and lent me money...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.86,0:14:50.85,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.45,0:14:59.77,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Um, we've brought the registration fee.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.35,0:15:01.96,Konosuba_Main,Luna,0000,0000,0000,,S-Sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.26,0:15:05.92,Konosuba_Italics,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Something told me she didn't want \Nto make eye contact with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.61,0:15:08.67,Konosuba_Main,Luna,0000,0000,0000,,Allow me to formally explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.67,0:15:11.97,Konosuba_Main,Luna,0000,0000,0000,,Adventurers each have their own occupations.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.57,0:15:14.64,Konosuba_Main,Luna,0000,0000,0000,,This is your registration card.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.13,0:15:18.43,Konosuba_Main,Luna,0000,0000,0000,,It keeps track of how many \Nmonsters you've vanquished.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.78,0:15:23.12,Konosuba_Main,Luna,0000,0000,0000,,As your level increases, you'll earn \Npoints that you can use to learn skills,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.12,0:15:25.36,Konosuba_Main,Luna,0000,0000,0000,,so please work hard to raise your level.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.72,0:15:29.36,Konosuba_Main,Luna,0000,0000,0000,,Now, both of you, please hold \Nyour hands over this crystal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.63,0:15:31.49,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.29,0:15:49.42,Konosuba_Main,Luna,0000,0000,0000,,With this, you will each \Nlearn your current status,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.42,0:15:53.14,Konosuba_Main,Luna,0000,0000,0000,,so please choose your desired \Noccupation based on your stats.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.60,0:15:54.81,Konosuba_Italics,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Here it comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.81,0:15:57.78,Konosuba_Italics,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Now my tremendous latent \Nabilities will be made apparent,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.78,0:16:00.85,Konosuba_Italics,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,and there'll be an uproar \Nthroughout the guild!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.85,0:16:06.47,Konosuba_Main,Luna,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.47,0:16:10.19,Konosuba_Main,Luna,0000,0000,0000,,Satou Kazuma-san, is it? Let me see...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.19,0:16:12.16,Konosuba_Main,Luna,0000,0000,0000,,Average across the board.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.16,0:16:14.41,Konosuba_Main,Luna,0000,0000,0000,,With the exception of \Ndecently high intelligence...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.41,0:16:17.56,Konosuba_Main,Luna,0000,0000,0000,,Oh? Your luck is extraordinarily high.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.56,0:16:21.81,Konosuba_Main,Luna,0000,0000,0000,,Of course, luck isn't a very \Nessential stat for an adventurer...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.81,0:16:23.57,Konosuba_Main,Luna,0000,0000,0000,,With this much luck,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.57,0:16:26.53,Konosuba_Main,Luna,0000,0000,0000,,I'd recommend becoming a \Nmerchant or something similar...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.47,0:16:30.62,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, she's disapproving of my adventurer's \Nlifestyle right off the bat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.62,0:16:31.84,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.12,0:16:33.42,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,U-Um,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.02,0:16:36.77,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,make my primary job "adventurer," please.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.77,0:16:41.02,Konosuba_Main,Luna,0000,0000,0000,,W-Well, you can always \Nchange jobs when you level up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.02,0:16:43.06,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Y-You're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.87,0:16:45.31,Konosuba_Italics,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,The weakest job, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.26,0:16:51.15,Konosuba_Main,Luna,0000,0000,0000,,Aside from your intelligence \Nbeing below average,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.15,0:16:53.14,Konosuba_Main,Luna,0000,0000,0000,,and your luck being the \Nlowest possible level,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.14,0:16:56.62,Konosuba_Main,Luna,0000,0000,0000,,all of your stats are \Ndrastically above average!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.65,0:16:59.70,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,What? Does that mean I'm really amazing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.70,0:17:03.37,Konosuba_Main,Luna,0000,0000,0000,,A-Amazing is an understatement!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.37,0:17:06.61,Konosuba_Main,Luna,0000,0000,0000,,The mage class, which requires \Nintelligence, is out of the question,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.61,0:17:08.96,Konosuba_Main,Luna,0000,0000,0000,,but other than that, \Nyou can be anything you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.96,0:17:12.39,Konosuba_Main,Luna,0000,0000,0000,,A crusader, sword master, arch priest...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.39,0:17:14.47,Konosuba_Main,Luna,0000,0000,0000,,Nearly any advanced class right from the start!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.47,0:17:18.67,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,I see. It's a shame there's \Nno "goddess" occupation,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.67,0:17:21.68,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,but in my case, maybe I'll be an \Narch priest who heals her allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.68,0:17:23.64,Konosuba_Main,Luna,0000,0000,0000,,An arch priest!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.64,0:17:27.12,Konosuba_Main,Luna,0000,0000,0000,,An almighty class that commands \Nall recovery and support magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.12,0:17:31.01,Konosuba_Main,Luna,0000,0000,0000,,and that boasts enough strength \Nto stand at the front line!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.75,0:17:40.12,Konosuba_Main,Luna,0000,0000,0000,,Without further ado, welcome to \Nour adventurer's guild, Aqua-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.58,0:17:44.12,Konosuba_Main,Luna,0000,0000,0000,,All of our staff will be looking \Nforward to your future exploits.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.86,0:17:49.28,Konosuba_Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Starting off as an arch priest is incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.59,0:17:54.01,Konosuba_Main,Man,0000,0000,0000,,Someone like you might actually be able \Nto beat the Devil King, you reckless girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.41,0:17:57.22,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,No event like this is going to happen for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.64,0:18:00.97,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,It's the adventurer's life for \Nus starting today, Kazuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.97,0:18:03.65,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,I thought you absolutely hated all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.65,0:18:05.21,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,Did I?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.45,0:18:17.11,Konosuba_Italics,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Well, anyway, everything thus far has \Nbeen basically character creation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.11,0:18:20.76,Konosuba_Italics,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Now our adventure is finally about to begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.00,0:20:09.24,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, this isn't right!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.54,0:20:10.85,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,What isn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.09,0:20:13.15,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,No, wait a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.37,0:20:16.80,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong? Did you forget to \Nuse the bathroom before bed?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.80,0:20:18.61,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,It's dark. Want me to go with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.61,0:20:21.47,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,No need! It's not that!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.77,0:20:23.02,Konosuba_Main,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,Keep it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.02,0:20:24.45,Konosuba_Main,Both,0000,0000,0000,,W-We're sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.24,0:20:31.58,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,We didn't come here to be laborers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.79,0:20:34.36,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, that's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.36,0:20:38.00,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,I need you to defeat the Devil King, \Nor I'll never be able to go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.70,0:20:47.89,Konosuba_Italics,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Her intelligence stat was \Nlower than a human's.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.16,0:20:51.99,Konosuba_Italics,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,All of the monsters near town have \Nbeen long since exterminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.99,0:20:56.10,Konosuba_Italics,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,With no monsters, there's no need \Nfor anyone to give us any fetch quests.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.38,0:21:00.28,Konosuba_Italics,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't want to learn something so realistic...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.64,0:21:01.86,Konosuba_Main,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for your business!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.94,0:21:16.63,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.58,0:21:21.77,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.38,0:21:23.09,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,Say...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.12,0:21:26.09,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,I was just thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.09,0:21:29.30,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go away from here and do a kill quest.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.30,0:21:32.45,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,We're level one. We don't even \Nhave full sets of equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.45,0:21:36.24,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,It'll be fine. As long as you have \Nme around, it'll be over in a flash!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.34,0:21:38.69,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,You can count on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.27,0:21:41.07,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,I feel very uneasy about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.40,0:21:43.50,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,Who do you think I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.37,0:21:48.34,Konosuba_Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,That's right. You {\i1}are{\i0} a goddess, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.60,0:21:50.47,Konosuba_Main,Aqua,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.17,0:21:55.95,Konosuba_Italics,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,And so our adventure began,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.95,0:21:58.40,Konosuba_Italics,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,for real this... time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.06,0:22:16.85,Konosuba_Show_Title,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1523,1)}KONOSUBA\N{\fs16\c&H6900D2&}God's {\c&H0781E7&}Blessing {\c&H0F135A&}on {\c&H6900D2&}this {\c&H0781E7&}Wonderful {\c&H0F135A&}World{\c&H6900D2&}!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.85,0:22:24.57,Konosuba_Show_Title2,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1,811)}KONOSUBA\N{\fs16\c&H6900D2&}God's {\c&H0781E7&}Blessing {\c&H0F135A&}on {\c&H6900D2&}this {\c&H0781E7&}Wonderful {\c&H0F135A&}World{\c&H6900D2&}!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.17,0:22:49.18,Konosuba_Ep_Number/Title,Sign,0001,0352,0110,,{\an8\fad(361,1)}Episode 1
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.17,0:22:49.18,Konosuba_Ep_Number/Title,Sign,0000,0000,0110,,{\fs14\fad(528,1)}"This Self-Proclaimed Goddess and Reincarnation in Another World!"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.97,0:23:40.03,wall o text,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Mom, I've come to a parallel world. \NI feel refreshed, as if I've been reborn. \NI've found a home and a job, and I'm full of energy. \NAnd best of all, a goddess has come along with me. \NSo please don't worry about me. \NI'll be all right... I'll be all right... Probably...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.97,0:23:40.03,Konosuba_Next_Ep_Number/Title,Sign,0001,0168,0074,,{\fs13}Episode {\c&HB400D0&}2
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.97,0:23:40.03,Konosuba_Next_Ep_Number/Title,Sign,0000,0000,0003,,{\c&HFFFAEC&}An Explosion {\c&H1B7CEB&}For This {\c&HA800D5&}Chuunibyou{\c&HFFFAEC&}!
